{"about_the_game":"<i>Congratulations! You just got hired by Dewitt Corp. for their memory program, your job starts tomorrow. </i><br>Our customers come to us to solve their current problems. Your task is to dig into their past and find the right memories to erase to change their present and future.<br>For each customer you will receive a series of personal information on your PC that you can analyze. Choose carefully, every memory removed can have enormous effects on the present and future of the customer.<br>You will be sent to an isolated place to be able to work with peace of mind, we will keep in touch via email.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Look into the clients\u2019 lives and discover their stories.  <br></li><li>Read emails sent by Alex\u2019s loved ones and look inside your work computer to find more about who she is.<br></li><li>Read news each day to learn more about the outside world.  <br></li><li>Every client has a unique story with different endings based on the memory you decide to delete.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cheat Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/b4dd7eed0a1f60d3280c4e53aabd5f47d86e8459.jpg"},{"name":"The Dark Side of the Internet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/a1933e59e60f9c73c9f694143b5f2390ac00a523.jpg"},{"name":"Family matters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/e09263c0e85a2177dfafa4e2ac8f7200fc62485b.jpg"},{"name":"Best Friends Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/cb33c81d07688e3b309d013b5f57f5f9aa3be413.jpg"},{"name":"End of Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/13c0560f63c20655ce826c99bb298ae7ba3929d0.jpg"},{"name":"Backfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1879820/df7